/slide/

# ── Root-level scratch (pattern-based, not by-name — see docs/decisions/) ────
# Leading / anchors to repo root so backend/src/.../data/ never matches.
/scratch_*.txt
/*.zip
/*.drawio
/*.png
/*.html
/*.xlsx
/new/
/WBS_LOG.txt

# ── Root-level scratch markdown (allowlist: everything except the real docs) ─
/*.md
!/README.MD
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md

